y\\to\\exists z\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R\\land z\\neq x\\land z\\neq y\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y\\to\\exists z\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R\\land z\\neq x\\land z\\neq y\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The strict comparison is derived from the upstream reflexive total order by adding inequality, so the density clause does not confuse <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Dense orders have no adjacent distinct elements.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}\">\\(\\mathbb{Q}\\)</span> is dense, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}\\)</span> is not.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)$ (reflexive total-order predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y\\to\\exists z\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R\\land z\\neq x\\land z\\neq y\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}","display":false}],"bytes":1054,"backlinks":[{"id":"f7968db43124080e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S$ (dense total-order predicate, see [[58-df-dense-order]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-409","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-dense-order.md|58-df-dense-order]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["043908345fb04de3"]}